  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Native row insertion selects the before/behind extreme and copies all actual boxes of the selected source row, retaining complete independent widths/heights and copied attributes.",
    "TOP transfer follows doc/tblrwcl copying flags: before keeps TOP only on first inserted row and clears original/subsequent copies; behind clears every new TOP and preserves source. All other edge attributes remain unchanged.",
    "ndtbl owns document row/column insertion with DoesUndo, temporary original boxes, scoped recording suppression/finally restoration and one success action.",
    "SwUndoTableNdsChg stores numeric selected/new starts and complete original attributes; undo resolves current actual inserted flat rows/sections; redo invokes Doc InsertRow or InsertCol, creating fresh owners. No retained row graph or duplicate shared-width vector.",
    "Six old retained-row identity fixtures migrate to actual fresh owners with complete attribute/text/style/cursor/Tab/table recreation checks preserved."
  ],
  "residuals": [
    "Merged/nested/spanned/protected graphs and full native layout/pooling/redline/autoformat/signed arithmetic remain partial and unverified.",
    "Native cursor/frame/full SaveTable structural reconstruction lifetimes and independent physical browser cell layout remain partial.",
    "Registered IO/open/save/recovery/settings remain byte-identical; no full module/upstream parity promotion."
  ]
}
